  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nCurrently, I'm using Synapse together with [mxisd](kamax-matrix/mxisd) as identity server (which uses LDAP as backend). It would be great if Synapse could occasionally check if the users still exist according to the identiy server, so that accounts can be automatically deactivated. A similar idea to https://docs.nextcloud.com/server/15/admin_manual/configuration_user/user_auth_ldap_cleanup.html, but then for identity servers in general instead of explicitly LDAP.",
